#: includes/class-admin.php:110
msgid ""
"This is a publishable key for browsers (pk_). The plugin calls the API from "
"your server, so it needs a secret key that starts with \"aw_\". Both keys "
"are on your dashboard at api.astroway.info/dashboard/keys."
